Earth is a world apart from [[Færrin]], far enough that the affairs of the Astra do not reach it. It is modern, a world of cities and machines. [[Geography/Los Diablos|Los Diablos]] is a city of California in the Great American Federation, and the animation studio [[Org/Bisney and Dixar/index|Bisney and Dixar]] works there.
